OL,3,AGirls as young as five targeted for
OL,4,Aupskirting as charges continue to rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FGirls as young as five have been
OL,7,Ftargeted for upskirting, new police
OL,8,Ffigures show.
OL,10,FOver the past three years, Wales' four
OL,11,Fforces received 219 complaints from
OL,12,Ffemales up to the age of 87, with 18
OL,13,Fpeople charged, results of Freedom of
OL,14,FInformation (FOI) requests reveal.
OL,16,FUpskirting involves taking a photo or
OL,17,Fvideo beneath someone's clothing -
OL,18,Fwithout their knowledge - with the
OL,19,Fintention of viewing their genitals,
OL,20,Fbuttocks or underwear.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
