OL,3,AGirls as young as five targeted for
OL,4,Aupskirting as charges continue to rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was made a criminal offence under
OL,7,Fthe Voyeurism (Offences) Act 2019 and
OL,8,Fcarries a maximum sentence of two years
OL,9,Fin prison.
